The ReSTIR story's weighted reservoir sampling
==============================================

$[Import* std]$[Import* render_lab_runtime]$[Import* render_lab_math]$[Import* paper_restir_values]$[Import* paper_restir_natives]$[Import* paper_restir_common]

Weighted reservoir sampling at one pixel

What the story draws on the canvas while P's candidates stream through a reservoir (chapter 2, beat `c2-wrs-stream`),
stage by stage as `wrsStage` goes from 0 to 17: the eight candidates as cards on a stream (a tape, at first), the
reservoir's record of three things, each candidate joining it (its weight into the sum, then its chance to
replace the kept one, against the number the update drew), the chance each ends kept, and the merge with a second
reservoir. The numbers are this frame's, from demos/ris.rs's trace of P's stream (the natives `risTrace`,
`risMerge`); before P's surface is read back the cards show no weights.


The stream's cards, along the top.
$[# _cardY 2.3]
Fn([Int, Int], Vec2). Card i's centre, of `n` in the row.
$[# {_cardAt i n} {v2 {* 1.6 {- {float i} {/ {float {- n 1}} 2.0}}} _cardY}]
Fn([Int], Float). The stage at which candidate i reaches the reservoir: the first at 6, the second at 7, the rest one
a stage from 9.
$[# {_joins i} {!if {= i 0} 6.0 {!if {= i 1} 7.0 {+ 9.0 {float {- i 2}}}}}]
Fn([Int], Float). The stage by which candidate i's weight is in the sum.
$[# {_joined i} {!if {< i 2} {+ {_joins i} 1.0} {+ {_joins i} 0.5}}]
Fn([Int], List(Float)). When candidate i's chance is weighed against its number: from, to (the first is kept as it
joins).
$[# {_decides i} {!if {= i 0}
    {' 6.0 7.0}
    {!if {= i 1} {' 8.0 9.0} {' {+ {_joins i} 0.5} {+ {_joins i} 1.0}}}}]

Fn([Vec2], List(Mob)). The highlight behind the card at `at`.
$[# {_cardLit at} {filled "lit"
    {box {sub2 at {v2 0.62 0.5}} {add2 at {v2 0.62 0.5}}}
    targetColor
    0.25}]
Fn([Int, Int, List({kept: Int, light: Int, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float}), Float], List(Mob)).
Card i: x_i and its weight, arriving at stage 0 to 1, dimmed once the reservoir has seen it, lit while it joins.
$[# {_card i n steps s}
    [# at {_cardAt i n}]
    [# frame {outlined f"{card${str i}}"
        {box {sub2 at {v2 0.62 0.5}} {add2 at {v2 0.62 0.5}}}
        textDimColor
        2.0}]
    [# name {moveTo
        {tex f"{cardName${str i}}" f"{x_{${str {+ i 1}}}}" 0.4 textColor}
        {add2 at {v2 0.0 0.2}}}]
    [# weight {!if {isEmpty steps}
        {'}
        {moveTo
            {tex f"{w${str i}}" {short {.w {nth steps i}}} 0.34 weightColor}
            {sub2 at {v2 0.0 0.22}}}}]
    [# card {flatten {' frame name weight}}]
    [# arrived {fadeIn
        {phase s {* 0.11 {float i}} {+ 0.25 {* 0.11 {float i}}}}
        {shift card {v2
            {* 1.5 {- 1.0 {smooth {phase s {* 0.11 {float i}} {+ 0.25 {* 0.11 {float i}}}}}}}
            0.0}}}]
    [# seen {!if {>= s {nth {_decides i} 1}} 0.45 1.0}]
    [# lit {!and {>= s {_joins i}} {< s {nth {_decides i} 1}}}]
    {!if lit {append {_cardLit at} {faded arrived seen}} {faded arrived seen}}]

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The stream as a tape, stages 1 to 4: two reels and the tape between them, a read head
passing once along it (stage 2 to 3), the tape giving way to the stream's arrow and its words (stage 3 to 4).
$[# {_tape s}
    [# {_reel x} {pathThrough "reel"
        {map
            {range 0 33}
            {^ {k}
                [# a {* {/ {float k} 32.0} {* 2.0 pi}}]
                {v2 {+ x {* 0.55 {cos a}}} {+ _cardY {* 0.55 {sin a}}}}}}
        textDimColor
        2.5}]
    [# tape {flatten {'
        {_reel -6.6}
        {_reel 6.6}
        {line "tapeTop" {v2 -6.6 {+ _cardY 0.55}} {v2 6.6 {+ _cardY 0.55}} textDimColor 2.0}
        {line "tapeBottom" {v2 -6.6 {- _cardY 0.55}} {v2 6.6 {- _cardY 0.55}} textDimColor 2.0}}}]
    [# head {arrowLine "head"
        {v2 {lerp -5.6 5.6 {smooth {phase s 2.0 3.0}}} {- _cardY 1.3}}
        {v2 {lerp -5.6 5.6 {smooth {phase s 2.0 3.0}}} {- _cardY 0.65}}
        accentColor
        3.0}]
    [# stream {append
        {arrowLine "stream" {v2 -6.6 {+ _cardY 0.75}} {v2 6.6 {+ _cardY 0.75}} textDimColor 2.0}
        {moveTo
            {caption "streamText" {textKey "wrsmath-stream"} 0.34 textDimColor}
            {v2 0.0 {+ _cardY 1.05}}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {fadeOut {phase s 3.0 3.5} {create {phase s 1.0 1.6} tape}}
        {!if {!and {>= s 2.0} {< s 3.2}} head {'}}
        {fadeIn {phase s 3.3 4.0} stream}}}]

The reservoir's record: the kept candidate, the sum of weights, and the count.
$[# _recordPlace [% {v2 -2.6 -1.0}]]

Fn([List({kept: Int, light: Int, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float}), Int, Float], List(String)). What
the first reservoir's record shows at stage s: the kept candidate, the sum (counting up as a weight joins), and the
count.
$[# {_fieldsAt s steps split}
    [# joined {filter {range 0 split} {^ {i} {>= s {_joins i}}}}]
    [# decided {filter {range 0 split} {^ {i} {>= s {nth {_decides i} 1}}}}]
    [# last {!if {isEmpty joined} -1 {nth joined {- {length joined} 1}}}]
    [# before {!if {< last 1} 0.0 {.wsum {nth steps {- last 1}}}}]
    [# sum {!if {< last 0}
        0.0
        {lerp before {.wsum {nth steps last}} {smooth {phase s {_joins last} {_joined last}}}}}]
    [# kept {!if {isEmpty decided} -1 {.kept {nth steps {nth decided {- {length decided} 1}}}}}]
    {' {keptName kept} {!if {< last 0} "" {short sum}} {!if {< last 0} "" {str {length joined}}}}]

Fn([List({kept: Int, light: Int, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float}), Float, Int], List(Mob)). Candidate
i weighing its chance at stage s: its weight over the new sum.
$[# {_weigh steps s i}
    [# step {nth steps i}]
    [# d {_decides i}]
    {chanceView f"{\frac{w_{${str {+ i 1}}}}{w_{\text{sum}}}}"
        {.w step}
        {.wsum step}
        {.u step}
        {.taken step}
        {phase s {nth d 0} {nth d 1}}
        {v2 4.4 -0.2}}]
Fn([List({kept: Int, light: Int, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float}), Int, Float], List(Mob)). The
candidate weighing its chance at stage s, if one is.
$[# {_chance steps split s}
    [# now {filter
        {range 1 split}
        {^ {i} {!and {>= s {nth {_decides i} 0}} {< s {nth {_decides i} 1}}}}}]
    {!if {isEmpty now} {'} {_weigh steps s {head now}}}]

Fn([List({kept: Int, light: Int, taken: Bool, u: Float, w: Float, wsum: Float}), Int, Float], List(Mob)). The
name of a candidate that replaces the kept one, flying from its card into the record's first field over the last
half of its chance (the record shows it once its chance is weighed).
$[# {_keptFly steps split s}
    [# flying {filter
        {range 0 split}
        {^ {i}
            [# d {_decides i}]
            {!and {.taken {nth steps i}} {>= s {lerp {nth d 0} {nth d 1} 0.5}} {< s {nth d 1}}}}}]
    {flatten {map flying {^ {i}
        [# d {_decides i}]
        [# from {moveTo
            {tex "flyName" {keptName i} 0.4 textColor}
            {add2 {_cardAt i split} {v2 0.0 0.2}}}]
        [# to {moveTo
            {tex "flyName" {keptName i} 0.44 textColor}
            {add2 _recordPlace {v2 -1.8 0.0}}}]
        {fromCopy {phase s {lerp {nth d 0} {nth d 1} 0.5} {nth d 1}} from to}}}}]

Merging two reservoirs

Section 3.2's merge (148:5): each reservoir's kept candidate is fed to a new reservoir as a fresh candidate whose
weight is that reservoir's whole sum of weights; the new count is the counts added (Alg. 4). Stages 16 to 21: the
first stream gives way, P's next eight candidates' reservoir appears beside the first, each reservoir becomes a
fresh candidate, a new reservoir takes them in turn (the second's chance its sum over both), the counts add, and the
new reservoir is all that is kept.

Fn([String, Vec2, Int, Float], List(Mob)). A fresh candidate: a reservoir's kept one, weighing its whole sum.
$[# {_freshCard id at kept w} {flatten {'
    {outlined {++ id "Box"} {box {sub2 at {v2 0.8 0.5}} {add2 at {v2 0.8 0.5}}} targetColor 2.5}
    {moveTo {tex {++ id "Name"} {keptName kept} 0.4 textColor} {add2 at {v2 0.0 0.2}}}
    {moveTo {tex {++ id "W"} {short w} 0.34 weightColor} {sub2 at {v2 0.0 0.22}}}}}]

A merge's numbers: each reservoir's kept candidate and sum, the count of each, the merge's number, and what it keeps.
$[# _Merge [% {Struct {'
    {Field "keptA" Int}
    {Field "sumA" Float}
    {Field "keptB" Int}
    {Field "sumB" Float}
    {Field "countA" Int}
    {Field "countB" Int}
    {Field "u" Float}
    {Field "kept" Int}}}]]

Fn([_Merge, List(Mob), Float], List(Mob)). The merge at stage s, the first reservoir's record (`first`) as the stream left
it.
$[# {_merging m first s}
    [# placeA {v2 -3.6 2.4}]
    [# placeB {v2 3.6 2.4}]
    [# placeC {v2 -2.8 -1.4}]
    [# a {toward first 1.0 placeA {phase s 16.0 16.6}}]
    [# b {append
        {record "B" placeB {keptName {.keptB m}} {short {.sumB m}} {str {.countB m}}}
        {moveTo
            {caption "nextText" {textKey "wrsmath-next"} 0.32 textDimColor}
            {add2 placeB {v2 0.0 1.4}}}}]
    [# total {+ {.sumA m} {.sumB m}}]
    [# taken {!and {>= {.keptB m} 0} {< {* {.u m} total} {.sumB m}}}]
    [# freshA {_freshCard "freshA" {v2 -1.4 0.7} {.keptA m} {.sumA m}}]
    [# freshB {_freshCard "freshB" {v2 1.4 0.7} {.keptB m} {.sumB m}}]
    [# fromA {_freshCard "freshA" {add2 placeA {v2 -1.8 0.0}} {.keptA m} {.sumA m}}]
    [# fromB {_freshCard "freshB" {add2 placeB {v2 -1.8 0.0}} {.keptB m} {.sumB m}}]
    [# kept {!if {< s 18.4} -1 {!if {< s 18.95} {.keptA m} {.kept m}}}]
    [# sum {!if {< s 18.2}
        -1.0
        {!if {< s 18.45}
            {* {.sumA m} {smooth {phase s 18.2 18.4}}}
            {lerp {.sumA m} total {smooth {phase s 18.45 18.55}}}}}]
    [# count {!if {< s 19.0}
        ""
        {!if {< s 19.5}
            f"{${str {.countA m}} + ${str {.countB m}}}"
            {str {+ {.countA m} {.countB m}}}}}]
    [# c {record "C" placeC {keptName kept} {!if {< sum 0.0} "" {short sum}} count}]
    [# countSum {record "C" placeC "" "" f"{${str {.countA m}} + ${str {.countB m}}}"}]
    [# countTotal {record "C" placeC "" "" {str {+ {.countA m} {.countB m}}}}]
    [# newC {!if {!and {>= s 19.5} {< s 20.0}}
        {append
            {filter c {^ {x} {!= {idOf x} "CF2"}}}
            {transform {phase s 19.5 20.0} {withId countSum "CF2"} {withId countTotal "CF2"}}}
        c}]
    [# dim {!if {< s 20.0} 1.0 {- 1.0 {* 0.55 {smooth {phase s 20.0 20.5}}}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {faded a dim}
        {faded {fadeIn {phase s 16.4 17.0} b} dim}
        {!if {< s 18.2}
            {fromCopy {phase s 17.0 17.6} fromA freshA}
            {fadeOut {phase s 18.2 18.5} freshA}}
        {!if {< s 18.6}
            {fromCopy {phase s 17.4 18.0} fromB freshB}
            {fadeOut {phase s 18.85 19.0} freshB}}
        {!if {< s 18.0}
            {'}
            {circumscribe {phase s 20.0 21.0} {write {phase s 18.0 18.2} newC} targetColor}}
        {!if {!and {>= s 18.2} {< s 18.5}}
            {fromCopy
                {phase s 18.2 18.5}
                {withId freshA "freshAName"}
                {moveTo
                    {tex "flyC" {keptName {.keptA m}} 0.44 textColor}
                    {add2 placeC {v2 -1.8 0.0}}}}
            {'}}
        {!if {!and taken {>= s 18.75} {< s 19.0}}
            {fromCopy
                {phase s 18.75 19.0}
                {withId freshB "freshBName"}
                {moveTo
                    {tex "flyC" {keptName {.keptB m}} 0.44 textColor}
                    {add2 placeC {v2 -1.8 0.0}}}}
            {'}}
        {!if {!and {>= s 18.5} {< s 19.0}}
            {chanceView f"{\frac{w^B_{\text{sum}}}{w^A_{\text{sum}} + w^B_{\text{sum}}}}"
                {.sumB m}
                total
                {.u m}
                taken
                {phase s 18.5 18.95}
                {v2 3.6 -0.9}}
            {'}}}}]

The scene

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The stream through a reservoir at stage `wrsStage`.
$[# wrsMath {: {^ {t}
    [# s {wrsStage}]
    [# steps {risTrace}]
    [# ready {not {isEmpty steps}}]
    [# merge {risMerge}]
    [# n {!if ready {length steps} 8}]
    [# split {!if ready {.split merge} 8}]
    [# cards {flatten {map {range 0 split} {^ {i} {_card i split steps s}}}}]
    [# fields {!if ready {_fieldsAt s steps split} {' "" "" ""}}]
    [# recordA {record "A" _recordPlace {nth fields 0} {nth fields 1} {nth fields 2}}]
    [# record {!if {< s 4.0}
        {'}
        {circumscribe {phase s 5.0 6.0} {write {phase s 4.0 4.8} recordA} targetColor}}]
    [# keptNow {!if ready {.kept {nth steps {- split 1}}} -1}]
    [# chances {!if {!or {not ready} {< s 15.0}}
        {'}
        {flatten {map
            {range 0 split}
            {^ {i}
                [# total {.wsum {nth steps {- split 1}}}]
                [# c {over {.w {nth steps i}} total}]
                [# at {_cardAt i split}]
                [# bar {filled f"{chanceBar${str i}}"
                    {box {v2 {- {.x at} 0.3} 0.4} {v2 {+ {.x at} 0.3} {+ 0.4 {* 1.2 c}}}}
                    estimateColor
                    0.85}]
                {append
                    {growFrom
                        {phase s {+ 15.0 {* 0.05 {float i}}} {+ 15.5 {* 0.05 {float i}}}}
                        bar
                        down}
                    {fadeIn
                        {phase s 15.4 15.8}
                        {nextTo
                            {tex f"{chance${str i}}" {numberLatex c 2} 0.3 estimateColor}
                            bar
                            up
                            0.08}}}}}}}]
    [# keptCard {!if {!and ready {>= s 15.6} {>= keptNow 0}}
        {circumscribe {phase s 15.6 16.0} {withId cards f"{card${str keptNow}}"} targetColor}
        {'}}]
    [# merged {: {.
        keptA {.kept {nth steps {- split 1}}}
        sumA {.wsum {nth steps {- split 1}}}
        keptB {.kept {nth steps {- n 1}}}
        sumB {.wsum {nth steps {- n 1}}}
        countA split
        countB {- n split}
        u {.u merge}
        kept {.kept merge}} _Merge}]
    [# merges {!and ready {> n split} {>= s 16.0}}]
    [# stream {flatten {' {_tape s} cards chances keptCard}}]
    {flatten {'
        {!if {< s 16.0} stream {fadeOut {phase s 16.0 16.4} stream}}
        {!if merges {_merging merged record s} record}
        {!if {!and ready {>= s 6.0} {< s 15.0}} {_chance steps split s} {'}}
        {!if ready {_keptFly steps split s} {'}}}}} Math}]
